#. module: account_move_send_cc_bcc
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_account_move_send_cc_bcc
msgid ""
"========================\n"
"Invoice Email Cc and Bcc\n"
"========================\n"
"\n"
".. \n"
"   !!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\n"
"   !! This file is generated by oca-gen-addon-readme !!\n"
"   !! changes will be overwritten.                   !!\n"
"   !!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\n"
"   !! source digest: sha256:979bf6bfcb53cf7a861e9ea5c7d72417aee335296a88a5cc71b6b7ce8c47a3b5\n"
"   !!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\n"
"\n"
".. |badge1| image:: https://img.shields.io/badge/maturity-Alpha-red.png\n"
"    :target: https://odoo-community.org/page/development-status\n"
"    :alt: Alpha\n"
".. |badge2| image:: https://img.shields.io/badge/license-AGPL--3-blue.png\n"
"    :target: http://www.gnu.org/licenses/agpl-3.0-standalone.html\n"
"    :alt: License: AGPL-3\n"
".. |badge3| image:: https://img.shields.io/badge/github-BM1--de%2Fodoo--mail--cc--bcc-lightgray.png?logo=github\n"
"    :target: https://github.com/BM1-de/odoo-mail-cc-bcc/tree/20.0/account_move_send_cc_bcc\n"
"    :alt: BM1-de/odoo-mail-cc-bcc\n"
"\n"
"|badge1| |badge2| |badge3|\n"
"\n"
"Adds the fields *Cc* and *Bcc* to the dialog that sends an invoice or a\n"
"credit note by email. The customer, the Cc recipients and the Bcc\n"
"recipients get **one single email** with the invoice attached, instead\n"
"of one email per recipient as Odoo sends them.\n"
"\n"
"Nobody sees who got a blind copy. In the chatter of the invoice the\n"
"message lists all recipients for internal users.\n"
"\n"
"The sending itself is done by the module *Email Cc and Bcc in One Email*\n"
"(``mail_send_cc_bcc``), which adds the same fields to the email composer\n"
"used for quotations, orders and messages. This module is installed\n"
"automatically when both it and Invoicing are installed.\n"
"\n"
".. IMPORTANT::\n"
"   This is an alpha version, the data model and design can change at any time without warning.\n"
"   Only for development or testing purpose, do not use in production.\n"
"   `More details on development status <https://odoo-community.org/page/development-status>`_\n"
"\n"
"**Table of contents**\n"
"\n"
".. contents::\n"
"   :local:\n"
"\n"
"Usage\n"
"=====\n"
"\n"
"- Open a posted invoice and click *Send*.\n"
"- Enter the recipients in *To*, *Cc* and *Bcc* and send. One email\n"
"  leaves Odoo.\n"
"\n"
"|The dialog that sends an invoice, with Cc and Bcc|\n"
"\n"
"Other modules pass the copies to the sending like the recipients, as\n"
"lists of partner IDs in the settings ``mail_partner_cc_ids`` and\n"
"``mail_partner_bcc_ids``:\n"
"\n"
"::\n"
"\n"
"   self.env[\"account.move.send\"]._generate_and_send_invoices(\n"
"       invoices,\n"
"       sending_methods=[\"email\"],\n"
"       mail_partner_cc_ids=cc_partners.ids,\n"
"   )\n"
"\n"
".. |The dialog that sends an invoice, with Cc and Bcc| image:: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/BM1-de/odoo-mail-cc-bcc/20.0/account_move_send_cc_bcc/static/description/invoice_send.png\n"
"\n"
"Known issues / Roadmap\n"
"======================\n"
"\n"
"- Sending several invoices at once has no dialog per invoice and\n"
"  therefore no Cc and Bcc.\n"
"- The Cc of the email template is added to *To* as Odoo does it in this\n"
"  dialog. The recipients still get one common email.\n"
"\n"
